{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you remember those wooden puzzles where you have to move a ball through a maze to reach the goal? Well, this game is based on a similar premise: to reach the goal, you have to rotate the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn it Around</strong> is a gravity-based puzzle game where, in each level, you must solve a small labyrinth by rotating it left or right. As you progress, new mechanics will be introduced, refreshing the experience and gradually increasing the complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features <strong>45 different levels</strong>, each one more challenging than the last, until they become true tests of logic and skill that will keep you entertained for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve all the intricate puzzles and help the balls return to their homeland, <strong>Bolaland</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584170/extras/bolaroja3.png?t=1743776094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"5 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3584170/7618960133bf509c3cd1d3d7323114d83e38a704.jpg"},{"name":"10 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3584170/4a1e9d1895bc6b0e27167ca917521a8b8bbe1c29.jpg"},{"name":"15 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3584170/9f5919e2d815e7c82bc36080ce06302084b6e4bf.jpg"},{"name":"20 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3584170/e56449cdc6d8b46600e9d0f09d7aa15074dd06bf.jpg"},{"name":"25 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3584170/0a74e491dd0fb8a7e9f9d5712bd7134f7e255a10.jpg"},{"name":"30 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3584170/0de4623202bac